::  name       tally garden pair-bound gate
::  shape      [count=@u32 cap=@u32] -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 while count stays at or under cap; answers 0 when count exceeds cap
::  example    3 7 -> 1 · 9 7 -> 0 · 7 7 -> 1
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend · Ashvini · STOA340
::  nib        equinox-stoa340-tally-pair-bound-v0
::
::  STOA340 — the relational gate earns its first vane desk. The a1 wall baked
::  gardens=8 as literal 7; this desk asks the same question with two runtime
::  faces, so Caravan and Mantra can mirror the pattern without memorizing caps.
|=  [count=@u32 cap=@u32]
?:  (gth count cap)  0  1
